SAFE NONVERBAL REFERENCE EVIDENCE (match these measured visual facts; never reproduce source copy or its containers): Reference 1 ÔÇö Canvas: square, aspect 1:1, White upper field transitioning through very pale blue into saturated cyan-blue across the lower third, with faint white grid lines and dotted accents over the blue-tinted area; Dominant visible colors: #FFFFFF, #F3F8FD, #0D80F4, #102F49, #111216, #4A91E8; Outer margin is approximately 7% of canvas width; foreground; Faint grid and dot field (pattern): x=0%, y=15%, width=100%, height=61%; background; Thin low-contrast white grid lines concentrated across the right and lower fields, plus small dotted matrices near the upper-right and left-middle edges.; REFERENCE BLUEPRINT: Canvas: square, aspect 1:1, White upper field transitioning through very pale blue into saturated cyan-blue across the lower third, with faint white grid lines and dotted accents over the blue-tinted area; Bright square canvas with a white upper base and blue lower transition; Right-side photography and bottom objects run into the canvas edges; Open whitespace is concentrated above the dashboard and around the upper text; Thin low-contrast white grid lines concentrated across the right and lower fields, plus small dotted matrices near the upper-right and left-middle edges; Analytics application frame (illustration): x=10%, y=40%, width=59%, height=43%; midground

