ines.","Dashboard donut module (KPI): x=38%, y=49%, width=19%, height=13%; foreground; White rounded card containing a blue segmented donut at left and four pale-blue dot-and-line legend rows at right.","Dashboard bar-chart module (KPI): x=15%, y=63%, width=20%, height=12%; foreground; White rounded card with a short gray header rule and alternating medium-blue and pale-blue vertical bars.","Dashboard dual-line module (KPI): x=36%, y=63%, width=22%, height=11%; foreground; White rounded chart card with a gray header rule, one rising blue polyline and one lower orange polyline over faint axes.","Floating automation icon stack (card): x=49%, y=34%, width=17%, height=17%; foreground; Three separate white rounded-square tiles with soft shadows: a wide upper tile with a blue robot and sparkle, then two smaller right-shifted tiles showing a blue clock-arrow symbol and a blue three-bar chart.","Integration icon dock (card): x=5%, y=81%, width=19%, height=8%; foreground; Translucent pale-blue rounded rectangle with a thin white border and soft shadow, containing three white rounded app tiles with orange bars, a multicolor triangular mark, and a blue loop mark.","Seated man (illustration): x=60%, y=35%, width=40%, height=61%; foreground; Photorealistic waist-up man cropped by the right edge, with dark hair, beard, black rectangular glasses, and a dark navy button-up shirt. He faces down-left and smiles toward the laptop; his forearms and hands extend toward the keyboard.","Open laptop (other): x=37%, y=74%, width=51%, height=26%; foreground; Large dark gray open laptop viewed obliquely; the blank back of the screen forms a broad trapezoid and overlaps the dashboard, the man''s torso, hands, and the dark tabletop.","Foreground drink and plant crop (other): x=82%, y=81%, width=18%, height=19%; foreground; Dark navy mug near the lower-right edge beside a partially visible white planter with green leaves; both are cropped by the bottom or right canvas edges.","Technical grid and