t-aligned percentages.","Wood desk band (band): x=0%, y=90%, width=100%, height=10%; background; Full-width light warm wood tabletop with horizontal grain, photographic texture, and foreground blur near the bottom edge.","Ceramic mug (other): x=1%, y=82%, width=18%, height=14%; midground; Cropped off-white ceramic cup with left-side handle, filled dark opening, soft reflections, and a shadow on the desk.","Notebook and pen (other): x=3%, y=92%, width=36%, height=8%; foreground; Angled white notebook cropped by the bottom edge with a black-and-silver pen laid diagonally across it; both cast soft photographic shadows.","Agency Analytics handle badge (logo): x=5%, y=90%, width=18%, height=5%; foreground; Black pill-shaped badge overlapping the mug and notebook, containing a white circular emblem at left and white ''@agencyanalytics'' text."],"retainedFamilyRules":["Visible upper-left topic label anchor.","Visible upper-left heavy headline anchor.","Visible rounded black headline highlight treatment.","Visible pale cyan full-bleed canvas treatment.","Visible lower-left black identity badge anchor.","Visible lower-half product-visual placement.","Preserve the square canvas.","Keep the editorial copy anchored to the upper-left margin.","Keep the headline on one line with only its second segment reversed in a black rounded rectangle.","Maintain a broad empty upper-right field.","Keep the laptop as the largest object and position it in the lower center-right.","Retain one smaller data card to the laptop''s left and one taller data card overlapping its right."]},{"role":"Challenge statement slide presenting two reporting problems above an analytics-dashboard illustration.","slideNumber":5,"referenceIndex":15,"uniqueStructure":["pale cyan canvas (other): x=0%, y=0%, width=100%, height=100%; background; Edge-to-edge light cyan background with a soft diffuse center glow and no visible outer border.","blue eyebrow label (other): x=6%, y=15%, width=17%, height=1%; foreground; Sma