background; Several blurred broad green leaves entering from the right edge behind the seated man.","Agency Analytics brand pill (logo): x=6%, y=90%, width=18%, height=5%; foreground; Black horizontally rounded pill containing a white circular emblem at left and the white handle ''@agencyanalytics'' at right.","Lower cyan field (band): x=0%, y=59%, width=59%, height=41%; background; Broad cyan portion of the continuous background transition, strongest at the bottom-left and fading upward and toward the center.","The primary headline occupies the upper-left at approximately y 14 to 21 percent.","The word ''Ahead'' is isolated in a black rounded capsule immediately after ''Stay''.","A single subtitle line sits about two percentage points below the headline.","The middle-left remains largely empty and shows only the blue background transition."],"retainedFamilyRules":["Upper-left bold headline anchor.","Black rounded highlight behind selected headline text.","Small subtitle directly beneath the headline.","Lower-left pill-shaped agency signature.","Edge-cropped photographic subject on a pale blue field.","Approximately 6 percent primary outer margin.","Keep the square canvas.","Preserve the upper-left text anchor near a 6 percent left margin.","Keep the headline on one line with the second word enclosed in a black rounded capsule.","Maintain a substantial empty interval below the subtitle.","Keep the dominant photographic subject in the lower-right with right-edge cropping.","Keep the laptop crossing the lower center in front of the subject."]}],"invariants":["A small blue eyebrow is positioned above the main title.","Black, white, and bright blue form the visible identity contrast.","Rounded white interface panels use subtle shadows.","The bottom-left black pill serves as the visible brand anchor.","The copy and identity badge share the same approximate left margin.","Maintain the square canvas and approximately 5.5% outer text margin.","Keep the complete copy block in the upper-left quadrant.","Keep the headline on one line with only its latter phrase inside a black rounded block.","Preserve exactly two bullet rows beneath the supporting statement.","Keep the large desktop panel as the dominant lower-half object.","Retain the phone-left, dashboard-center, calendar-right overlap sequence.","Keep the black identity pill overlapping the phone near the bottom-left.","Centered black handle capsule as a visible identity anchor.","Centered typographic axis shared by headline, support line, and CTA.","Edge-cropped blue-and-white data graphics as peripheral framing.","Bright upper whitespace transitioning into a denser blue lower field.","Preserve substantial open space above the calendar and to the right of the headline.","Keep the square canvas and full-bleed white-to-blue vertical transition.","Keep the identity capsule centered near the top.","Keep the headline and supporting statement centered on the same vertical axis."],"imageryAndDepth":["The dominant visual is the desktop dashboard at x=22.1%, y=50.6%, width=51%, height=37.4%.","All imagery is rendered as crisp software-interface mockups rather than photography.","The phone sits in front of the dashboard''s lower-left edge.","The calendar sits in front of the dashboard''s right edge.","The identity badge sits in front of the phone near the bottom-left.","Soft shadows fall around the white panels, producing shallow layered depth.","The phone is vertically cropped near the bottom by the canvas and badge.","Lighting is represented by the pale central background glow rather than directional highlights.","No photographic imagery or human subject is present.","The dominant visual is the centered headline block at x=31.8, y=42.7, width=36.5, height=6.3.","Decorative dashboard cards occupy the lower side edges and frame rather than replace the text.","Rear cards are larger, more translucent, and sit behind smaller front cards.","Cards use rounded corners, faint outlines, and soft translucency rather than strong drop shadows.","Network lines remain behind the foreground cards but cross the blue background.","Bright circular nodes create localized glow without a directional light source.","No photograph or person is present.","The dominant visual is the analytics dashboard at x 16.6%, y 54.5%, width 55.4%, height 33.6%.","The dashboard is a flat white rounded panel with a diffuse shadow lifting it from the background.","The donut-chart card sits in front of and overlaps the dashboard''s right edge.","The dotted wave pattern remains behind both cards."],"prohibitedDrift":["Do not convert the composition into a centered headline layout.","Do not replace the pale cyan field with a photograph or dark background.","Do not enlarge the phone or calendar to exceed the desktop dashboard.","Do not turn the interface montage into a single flat screenshot.","Do not add extra bullets, KPI cards, selected calendar dates, or schedule rows.","Do not move the identity badge to a top corner.","Do not replace the black headline highlight with an underline, outline, or blue box.","Do not add decorative patterns, illustrations, people, or carousel controls.","Do not convert the page into a left-right text and image split.","Do not enlarge the logo into the dominant visual.","Do not move the headline into the top third.","Do not turn the CTA into a rectangular outlined button.","Do not place an uncropped dashboard in the center.","Do not substitute photographs, people, devices, or browser windows.","Do not introduce warm colors unsupported by the canvas.","Do not replace the pale upper field with dark blue.","Do not remove the side cropping or flatten all cards onto one depth layer.","Do not convert the composition into a balanced two-column split.","Do not move the dashboard into the upper-right text area.","Do not replace the dashboard with a photograph, person, device, or abstract icon."],"colorAndContrast":["Black and charcoal typography appears on the pale cyan background.","White headline text appears only inside the black highlight block.","Bright blue is used for the eyebrow, bullets, controls, icons, selected dates, and sparklines.","White interface panels contrast softly with the cyan field.","Light gray borders and dividers organize the dashboard without strong outlines.","Small green dots provide the only non-blue accent within the interface.","Black headline and charcoal supporting copy sit over the near-white center.","The top logo uses white marks on a nearly black capsule.","The CTA uses black text on a white pill over pale cyan.","Chart cards are white or translucent white against cyan and blue.","Chart marks use medium and saturated blues.","White network lines and glowing nodes contrast most strongly against the saturated lower blue.","Black and charcoal typography contrasts against the pale-cyan canvas.","Bright blue is restricted to the eyebrow, bullet dots, chart lines, chart markers, and KPI deltas.","The headline highlight uses white text on solid black.","Dashboard surfaces are white and off-white with pale-gray internal borders.","Chart grid lines and secondary labels use low-contrast gray.","The lower decorative dots use cyan shades close to the background value.","The bottom identity badge is black with white symbol and lettering.","Black and charcoal typography sits on a very pale cyan background."],"densityAndRhythm":["There are three primary interface objects: one desktop panel, one phone, and one calendar card.","There are two action bullets.","The desktop schedule contains three repeated report rows.","The desktop KPI area contains four evenly divided metrics.","The calendar uses a seven-column grid with four selected dates.","Reading order proceeds from eyebrow to headline, support line, bullets, then lower interface montage.","Vertical copy gaps increase between the headline group and the action list.","The upper-right quadrant remains largely empty.","The lower half is visually dense due to overlapping panels.","One logo, two centered text blocks, one CTA, four chart cards, and multiple background pattern groups are visible.","The upper 40% contains mostly empty white space.","The headline-to-subtitle gap is approximately 3% of canvas height.","The subtitle-to-CTA gap is approximately 10% of canvas height.","The CTA is isolated from both text and lower network graphics.","Visual density increases progressively from the center toward the bottom edge.","Reading order is logo, headline, supporting statement, CTA, then peripheral chart imagery.","Reading order proceeds from eyebrow to headline, subheading, two bullets, dashboard, overlay chart, then bottom-left handle.","There are two bullet rows.","There is one large dashboard card and one overlapping chart card.","The dashboard includes four KPI tiles and one large line-chart module."],"referenceIndexes":[11,12,13,14,15,16],"typographyBehavior":["All visible typography is sans serif.","The eyebrow is small, blue, single-line, and left aligned.","The headline is very large, heavy, and confined to one line.","The black highlight closely follows the height and width of the final two headline words.","The supporting statement is medium-sized, bold, and single-line.","Both action items are bold, single-line, and aligned after equal blue bullet indents.","Interface typography is substantially smaller, with dark labels and lighter gray metadata.","All visible text is horizontally centered.","The primary headline uses one line, heavy weight, and the largest scale.","The supporting statement uses one line, bold weight, and roughly half the headline height.","The CTA label uses a smaller bold face with expanded letter spacing.","The logo handle uses compact white sans-serif text inside the black capsule.","No colored text highlight, underline, or multiline body copy is visible.","All editorial text is left aligned.","The eyebrow is small, bold, blue, and set on one line.","The headline is one line, oversized, heavy-weight sans serif.","A rounded black highlight encloses only the final two headline words.","The subheading is one line, bold, and markedly smaller than the headline.","The two bullet statements use matching large bold sans-serif styling.","Dashboard labels are small and gray, while metric values are larger and dark."],"recurringComponents":["Small blue eyebrow label.","Oversized one-line headline with partial black capsule highlight.","Blue circular list bullets.","White rounded interface panels with faint borders and shadows.","Pale-blue square icon tiles.","Thin gray internal dividers.","Blue active controls and selected states.","Green circular schedule-status indicators.","Black pill-shaped identity badge.","One black rounded identity capsule","One large centered headline","One centered supporting statement","One white rounded CTA capsule","Two large rear chart cards","Two smaller front KPI cards","One lower network mesh","Several faint dotted matrices","Curved translucent blue bands at the bottom","Small blue eyebrow text.","Oversized black headline with a black rounded highlight behind selected white words.","Single-line dark supporting subheading.","Two blue-dot bullet rows.","Large white rounded analytics panel.","Four compact KPI tiles."]}},"infographicGuidelines":"## Evidence index\nPalette evidence: white, pale cyan, bright blue, navy, black, with occasional orange chart accents. Type evidence: heavy geometric sans-serif headlines, compact sans-serif support copy, and selective blue or white-on-black emphasis; exact fonts are unverified. Motifs: faint grids, dots, arcs, blue waves, pill CTAs, rounded analytics cards. Imagery: layered dashboards, laptops, cropped working subjects. Layouts: open upper copy fields over dense lower product scenes."},"features":{"static":{"feature":"static","payload":{"layouts":[{"name":"Demo Brand Right-Side Hero","prompt":"PURPOSE: Create a right-weighted hero background with a permanently clear left copy zone. Create a square 1:1, 1080x1080 full-bleed AI background for Demo Brand. The result is not a finished poster: deterministic HTML overlays add all real copy, logo, and CTA.\n\nEVIDENCE BASIS: Reference 1 ÔÇö Canvas: square, aspect 1:1, White upper field transitioning through very pale blue into saturated cyan-blue across the lower third, with faint white grid lines and dotted accents over the blue-tinted area; Dominant visible colors: #FFFFFF, #F3F8FD, #0D80F4, #102F49, #111216, #4A91E8; Outer margin is approximately 7% of canvas width; AgencyAnalytics deterministic overlay reserve lockup (deterministic overlay reserve): x=7%, y=5%, width=26%, height=4%; foreground; Black circular angular emblem followed by the black wordmark; the second word is heavier than the first; Reports Clients Love headline (headline): x=8%, y=14%, width=34%, height=4%; foreground; Single-line bold sans-serif headline in black, with the middle word Clients highlighted in bright blue; Supporting statement (other): x=8%, y=21%, width=50%, height=6%; foreground; Two lines of heavy black sans-serif text, left aligned, with a wide line break after the words save time; Learn More button (other): x=7%, y=34%, width=20%, height=6%; foreground; Dark navy horizontal pill with centered bold white label; Faint grid and dot field (pattern): x=0%, y=15%, width=100%, height=61%; background; Thin low-contrast white grid lines concentrated across the right and lower fields, plus small dotted matrices near the upper-right and left-middle edges.\n\nREFERENCE BLUEPRINT: Canvas: square, aspect 1:1, White upper field transitioning through very pale blue into saturated cyan-blue across the lower third, with faint white grid lines and dotted accents over the blue-tinted area; Dominant visible colors: #FFFFFF, #F3F8FD, #0D80F4, #102F49, #111216, #4A91E8; Outer margin is approximately 7% of canvas width; Bright square canvas with a white upper base and blue lower transition; No visible outer border or corner rounding; Primary left m